e number 67 when she turns on the  mutant liberation front  joining the ranks of x-force soon  afterwards in the penultimate  issue of the 2005 mini-series house of m  wanda maximoff makes history by  stripping most of the world's mutants of  their powers  dr strange manages to shield a mere 198  mutants from wanda's wrath so that they  can keep their abilities  but mirage isn't one of them in new  x-men number 20  emma frost sends mirage home along with  the other de-powered teachers and  students  but dany doesn't sit around twiddling  her thumbs and in the wake of 2006's  line-wide event civil war  she's recruited to help train a new  generation of heroes  eventually however she's shown the door  when she proves more interested in  helping the young hero trauma rather  than turning him into a weapon for the  government  she would later teach younger mutants in  the pages of young x-men  with her experience as well as her  on-again off-again valkyrie abilities  dany remains an asset to the x-men and  other marvel heroes  however she doesn't regain her mutant  powers until 2019's uncanny x-men number  15.  earlier it had been discovered that dany  and other mutants were infected with the  alien transmode virus  and are subsequently used as government  weapons but when dark beast figures out  a cure for the virus  dany's abilities return along with the  abilities of her fellow mutants  the 2019-20 marvel comics line-wide  event dawn of x  completely revamped the x franchise now  almost all mutants live on the sentient  island of krakowa  where professor x magneto and other  mutant leaders have built a new utopia  as part of this event a number of old  titles were given a new lease on life  including new mutants in 2019's new  mutants number one  the old team reforms with most of its  classic characters  danny is once again part of the team  although it's not initially clear  whether she'll once again assume a  leadership role  after all magic is one of krakowa's  captains cipher is on the mutant  nation's governing body  and sunspot has led a couple of teams of  avengers since his last stint with the  new mutants  so if dany wants to be a team leader she  may have some competition  regardless it's safe to assume mirage is  happy to be back with her old teammates  again  particularly her dear friend wolfsbane  rayne had died from a brutal beating in  2019's uncanny x-men number 17  but resurrecting mutants is one of the  miracles of krakowa  and new mutants number one opens with  mirage's closest friend  returning to the world of the living  check out one of our newest videos right  here  plus even more looper videos about your  favorite movies are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one

